You are a senior full-stack engineer.

Implement a complete Meta Analytics module inside an existing React + Vite Admin Dashboard and Node.js + Express + MongoDB backend.

Context:

* A website analytics dashboard already exists.
* Do NOT replace the existing dashboard.
* Create a new sidebar menu item called "Meta Analytics".
* The feature should support Facebook Pages and Instagram Business Accounts connected through Meta Login.

User Flow:

1. Admin opens Admin Panel.
2. Admin clicks "Meta Analytics" in sidebar.
3. If no Meta account is connected:

   * Show a "Connect Facebook & Instagram" button.
   * Start Meta OAuth flow.
4. After successful login:

   * Fetch available Facebook Pages.
   * Allow admin to select a Page.
   * Automatically detect linked Instagram Business Account.
5. Save connection.
6. Open Meta Analytics Dashboard.

Frontend Requirements:

Create a dedicated Meta Analytics page.

Connection State:

* Connected Account Card
* Facebook Page Name
* Facebook Page Picture
* Instagram Username
* Connected Date
* Disconnect Button

Overview Cards:

* Followers
* Reach
* Impressions
* Engagement
* Profile Visits
* Website Clicks
* Total Posts
* Total Reels

Charts:

* Followers Growth
* Reach Trend
* Engagement Trend
* Impressions Trend

Filters:

* Today
* 7 Days
* 30 Days
* 90 Days
* Custom Range

Posts Table:
Columns:

* Thumbnail
* Platform
* Caption
* Posted Date
* Likes
* Comments
* Reach
* Impressions
* Engagement Rate

Top Performing Posts Section:

* Top 10 posts sorted by engagement.

Backend Requirements:

Create a Meta Integration module.

Collections:

MetaAccount

{
adminId,
pageId,
pageName,
pagePicture,
instagramBusinessAccountId,
instagramUsername,
accessToken,
tokenExpiresAt,
connectedAt,
status
}

MetaAnalyticsDaily

{
adminId,
date,
followers,
reach,
impressions,
engagement,
profileVisits,
websiteClicks
}

API Endpoints:

GET /api/meta/connect

GET /api/meta/callback

GET /api/meta/status

POST /api/meta/disconnect

GET /api/meta/pages

POST /api/meta/select-page

GET /api/meta/overview

GET /api/meta/followers

GET /api/meta/reach

GET /api/meta/impressions

GET /api/meta/posts

GET /api/meta/top-posts

Meta Permissions Required:

pages_show_list
pages_read_engagement
instagram_basic
instagram_manage_insights
read_insights
business_management

Analytics Sources:

Facebook Graph API

Instagram Graph API

Store analytics history in MongoDB so charts continue to work even if Meta temporarily limits requests.

Implement:

* Token validation
* Automatic token refresh
* Proper error handling
* Loading states
* Reconnection flow
* Disconnect flow

UI Requirements:

* Match existing admin dashboard design.
* Reuse existing card components.
* Reuse existing chart components if available.
* Responsive desktop and mobile layout.

Expected Deliverables:

1. new Controllers and route for meta work
2. Setup instructions